Defend machine elements as an interacting assembly (@mech-elements-review: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mechanical-engineering, #source "../sources/FUNdaMENTALS-of-Design-Slocum.lingua#r_58Q6VQJ3FXXGXRBJ3DK0AVC3WQ", #source "../sources/Elements-of-Mechanical-Design-MIT-2-72.lingua#r_31S9Z88TMF2875BF5KA5825GX7", #mechanical-engineering "../design/Requirements-describe-use-and-evidence.lingua#r_1509Y6D06KQ6MS7EVFXC8ZQ4YV") { r_6R4CPQRB4ACH3KPZZZH5N3TFTN
**Read:** Complete [FUNdaMENTALS of Design — Alexander Slocum](../sources/FUNdaMENTALS-of-Design-Slocum.lingua#r_58Q6VQJ3FXXGXRBJ3DK0AVC3WQ)'s ten-topic book and the available [Elements of Mechanical Design — MIT 2.72, Spring 2009](../sources/Elements-of-Mechanical-Design-MIT-2-72.lingua#r_31S9Z88TMF2875BF5KA5825GX7) sequence through component design, including substantial exercises. Read the full relevant source sections for every selected element; use the source Records to distinguish the public teaching material from separately sold references.

Explain one useful machine through motion constraints, force and energy transfer, structural response and its component interfaces. Derive and independently check the key relations before presenting a catalogue selection. Keep operating state, geometry, material condition, uncertainty and evidence attached to the conclusion.

**Demonstrate:** Complete the transmission, precision-motion and joint studies, reusing Records and work where their questions overlap. Compare alternatives, investigate a disagreement with evidence and revise the explanation. A correct gear ratio, bearing-life number or stress result alone cannot establish the machine's useful performance.

Continue through the connected requirements, drawings, manufacturing, dimensional verification, assembly, commissioning and service studies. Carry the component evidence into the worked machine account, physical characterization and independent research.

**Return:** [Mechanical engineering and machine design](../Mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design.lingua#r_0017YZ63HZBZ4P4WD8DECVWE4R).
**Continue:** [Requirements describe use and evidence](../design/Requirements-describe-use-and-evidence.lingua#r_1509Y6D06KQ6MS7EVFXC8ZQ4YV).

